# 提交信息规范

遵循 [Conventional Commits 1.0](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/):

```
<type>(<scope>): <subject>
<空行>
[<body, 解释 why 不是 what>]
<空行>
[<footer, e.g. BREAKING CHANGE / Refs #123>]
```

## type(必填)

| type | 用途 |
|---|---|
| `feat` | 新功能(对应 MINOR 版本) |
| `fix` | 修 bug(对应 PATCH 版本) |
| `perf` | 性能优化(不改行为) |
| `refactor` | 重构(不改行为也不改性能) |
| `docs` | 仅文档 / 注释 |
| `test` | 仅测试 / 评测脚本 |
| `build` | 构建系统、依赖、`.gitignore`、`requirement.txt`、Dockerfile |
| `ci` | CI 配置(github actions 等) |
| `chore` | 杂项(scripts/、tools/、辅助代码) |
| `revert` | 回滚某个 commit |

**Breaking change**:type 后加 `!`(如 `feat(head)!: rewrite InstanceBank API`),并在 body 用 `BREAKING CHANGE: <说明>` footer。

## scope(可选,但推荐)

本仓库常用 scope:`head / backbone / decoder / instance_bank / dataset / sampler / loss / ops / scripts / docs / tools / config`

## subject(必填)

- < 50 字符,小写开头,**不加句号**
- 用动词原形(`add` / `fix` / `replace` / `remove`),不用过去式
- 描述"做了什么",不是"为什么"

## body(可选,推荐)

- 解释 **why** 和 **trade-off**,不重复 diff 已经看得到的内容
- 行宽 ≤ 72 字符
- 跟 subject 之间空一行

## 示例

```
feat(head): add PF-Track Past/Future Reasoning module

Insert a SpatialTemporalReasoner between InstanceBank.cache and the
final decoder output. History (3 frames) refines current query via
hist_temporal_transformer; future prediction (8 steps) is used to keep
occluded tracks alive.

Refs: docs/research/sparse4dv3_improvement_plan.md (B1)
```

```
fix(ops): make deformable_aggregation import work in both develop/install modes

torch 2.3 install mode places .so at site-packages/, not at ops/. Use
`try: from . import ...; except: import ...` so the same code works in
venv (develop) and image (install) layouts.
```
